[{"title":"山居约马自牧同隐","author":"王称","text":"卜筑远嚣尘，松泉落涧滨。\n山云常共醉，海月不羞贫。\n看竹琴留客，寻芝鹿傍人。\n露巾裁落芰，野饭荐香芹。\n树变啼园鸟，溪游纵壑鳞。\n蕙床眠薄暝，桂酒赏芳春。\n入社高僧共，寻山短屐频。\n市城能扫迹，迟尔结为邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠童将军","author":"王称","text":"圣德垂文统，开疆仗武臣。\n熊罴偏兆渭，崧岳再生申。\n控节三边静，讴歌万国春。\n策勋来汗马，剖劵寄雄闉。\n何处推名阀，淮阳识异人。\n起家龙剑旧，锡命虎符新。\n略地功名在，专城宠渥臻。\n朔方推邓禹，南土戴曹彬。\n事业谁能拟，贤郎更绝伦。\n凤毛看鸑鷟，骥种得麒麟。\n勇略仍无匹，雄韬动有神。\n声名传此日，光彩擅常陈。\n阃外今无事，边陲早控尘。\n辘轳閒夜月，睥睨倚秋旻。\n国士延毛遂，华筵召郤诜。\n五羊流美颂，百粤仰深仁。\n自笑飘蓬客，难同入幕宾。\n辕门叨接猛，斗篆未誇秦。\n王粲登楼处，相如作赋晨。\n不因知己恋，谁作浪游身。\n伏枥心犹壮，挛鞲气未驯。\n素书如可试，黄石旧为邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝珠兰若","author":"王称","text":"万花明晚嶂，一径霭天香。\n问法逢龙胜，寻山到雁堂。\n梵轮标月相，石镜让珠光。\n野兴看云逸，松泉捲幔凉。\n洗心依觉苑，作礼面空王。\n初地超凡品，泠然万虑忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒋山法会瑞应诗应制作","author":"王称","text":"宝地奉金仙，璇宫启梵筵。\n真僧腾异域，开士唱三缘。\n说法云成盖，谈经花雨天。\n祥光凝彩绚，甘露泻珠圆。\n天乐凭虚下，神灯彻夜悬。\n胜因济妙筏，觉路指迷川。\n秪树春光溢，灵山会俨然。\n愿兹宏至化，皇运共千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鹿应制","author":"王称","text":"乐囿歌周室，呈祥出汉圻。\n神胚金毓秀，瑞采玉为姿。\n顾兔宁堪匹，祥乌未足奇。\n露毛偏濯濯，霜角自离离。\n漫点苍崖雪，曾衔紫岭芝。\n来依琪苑静，驯傍玉阶宜。\n海峤遗仙迹，穷荒贡赤墀。\n何如昭景贶，重睹圣明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人戍边","author":"王称","text":"玉勒浮云骑，雕鞬明月弓。\n日边辞帝辇，天际逐沙蓬。\n百战兵符动，三门将略雄。\n戈矛明积雪，旌旆叠高风。\n朔漠穷阴外，幽关落照中。\n壮怀何以赠，剑气欲吹虹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林思和校文","author":"王称","text":"冠冕长林后，诗书百粤尊。\n九侯传世泽，双阙表名门。\n学海文风盛，黉宫教雨存。\n朋簪方济济，逝水竟沄沄。\n寂寞馀诗社，飘零散酒樽。\n琴书徒尔恨，钟鼎更谁论。\n夜月看归鹤，秋猿伴旅魂。\n园林荒竹树，风雨败兰荪。\n走讣惊千里，悲歌向九原。\n犹疑骑列宿，箕尾不堪扪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天台梁氏聚青山房","author":"王称","text":"绝巘邻沧岛，中峰接上台。\n林间别阜出，窗外聚青来。\n选胜宜招隐，栖幽异凿坯。\n白云华顶鹤，瀑布石屏雷。\n羽客停鸾吹，仙人共酒杯。\n烟霞林鹿伴，冠盖岭猿猜。\n自笑羁尘内，何由避俗媒。\n凭题紫芝曲，寄谢赤城隈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题嘉禾杨郡守绿野亭","author":"王称","text":"南藩开别邸，五马驻仙軿。\n地接三吴壮，山连百粤青。\n簪缨延上客，诗酒聚文星。\n妒舞花当户，传歌鸟近屏。\n园丁供核篚，野老献茶经。\n架展黄封轴，门题墨客铭。\n白云随捲幔，华月似窥棂。\n雅趣林泉洽，幽怀海岳冥。\n徐生高士宅，扬子草玄亭。\n未足同风调，徒应袭露萤。\n须知颍川政，鸣凤下郊坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈陈司马","author":"王称","text":"大将分雄阃，名卿出上台。\n六韬资庙略，万里扫炎埃。\n铁骑如云集，楼船际晓开。\n月将弓影满，霜逐剑锋摧。\n宠赉当阳节，人怜定远材。\n指麾停羽箑，谈笑许龙媒。\n铜柱功宁羡，金台志不回。\n岂伊专钺斧，更尔赖盐梅。\n自笑疲驽甚，聊因附骥来。\n未携孙楚策，屡接祢衡杯。\n汲引宁忘自，吹嘘幸见陪。\n酬恩看玉剑，千里动风雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"环璧轩为刘佥宪题","author":"王称","text":"宪节依南纪，开轩得最幽。\n引泉窥蜃胍，凿地应龟谋。\n团魄疑初堕，轮光讶未收。\n不随方沼合，宜傍月江流。\n荷盖侵书幌，芹香点客裘。\n漫同瞻泮水，非是奠圆丘。\n蒲谷生当异，琮璜势欲侔。\n奎文时贯户，云汉半藏陬。\n色媚沉珠浦，辉联钓玉洲。\n探源穷妙理，观化仰前修。\n映采回轺鹭，忘机狎野鸥。\n鉴容堪整佩，濯足诧垂钩。\n槛俯花如笑，桥成木自樛。\n燕冲飞絮入，鱼噞乱萍浮。\n润溥台前柏，声谐阼外璆。\n瑩深瑕不染，光重价难酬。\n才子誇神遇，群公事胜游。\n赋诗偕酌泂，载酒拟消愁。\n凉思通规牖，清源得上游。\n悬车曾有约，挥棹倚高秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海珠寺示同游文宪使周佥宪","author":"王称","text":"绝岛波心见，栖身玉镜中。\n欲观鳌背日，还仗鹢楼风。\n客思员壶外，云程若木东。\n蜃光晴作雾，海气昼成虹。\n僧刹蛟龙护，神珠水月通。\n同游多逸侣，归棹拟乘空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其一","author":"王称","text":"飞雪迥千里，春来草不生。\n晓辞骠骑幕，夜薄左贤营。\n性命酬恩宠，心魂恋苦旌。\n谁知麟阁上，青简贮芳名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其二","author":"王称","text":"中夜旄头跃，将军远戍边。\n碛昏旗影暗，水滑马蹄穿。\n剑拂秋霜冷，弓弯塞月圆。\n直须清大漠，万里勒燕然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其三","author":"王称","text":"代马风云色，吴驹霜雪明。\n三边传警候，万里事横行。\n拟促阴山骑，遥连瀚海兵。\n愿开沙漠北，持答泰阶平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其四","author":"王称","text":"远戍金微道，一上单于台。\n关门秋色断，羌笛夜声哀。\n少妇龙沙梦，长安鹤使回。\n祇今青海月，流影碧天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陇头水","author":"王称","text":"陇底望秦关，萧萧陇水寒。\n照人犹带恨，饮马不成湍。\n落日边尘合，秋风候骑残。\n谁磨三尺剑，直为斩楼兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝","author":"王称","text":"春光晓渐饶，杨柳暗宫桥。\n嫩叶凝愁黛，纤枝倦舞腰。\n祗应悲戍?，那解绾兰桡。\n更待花如霰，红颜为尔凋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花落","author":"王称","text":"青楼叹落梅，独起自徘徊。\n带雪粘歌扇，因风上镜台。\n晚妆谁更点，边角正堪哀。\n望断寻香径，依依满绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小垂手","author":"王称","text":"秦女骋妖娆，春风步翠翘。\n只疑花作脸，更讶柳为腰。\n烛暗花钿堕，风轻罗带飘。\n自矜纤弱态，不羡掌中娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巫山高","author":"王称","text":"巫山不可望，望极使人悲。\n树暗啼?峡，云空神女祠。\n秋声留别恨，夜月怅佳期。\n欲问高唐事，惟应宋玉知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚归湖上","author":"王称","text":"一径惬幽寻，悠然世外心。\n不缘流水泛，那识落花深。\n潭影澄天镜，松声韵素琴。\n前林烟磬发，归晚月沉沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶行山中得清冷泉","author":"王称","text":"万籁晓俱寂，风泉有远音。\n偶随清嶂去，因到白云深。\n喷薄疑飞雪，冷清可照心。\n坐来天影澹，一曲韵瑶琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山寺寻僧","author":"王称","text":"寻山忆慧能，问偈遇真僧。\n竹覆山门雪，花藏古殿灯。\n千家供法食，一衲絓疏藤。\n不是遗经咒，多应悟上乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻郑道士坐清晖阁","author":"王称","text":"吟秋入翠微，高阁坐清晖。\n鸿宝传真诀，清斋话息机。\n涧云生野屐，山雨拂尘衣。\n自是支离久，依方早有归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆陈升","author":"王称","text":"京国一为别，桥门十载春。\n齑盐朝共饭，风雨夜连茵。\n玉树谁先折，泉台竟不晨。\n空将知己泪，西望洒风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过董江台怀从范","author":"王称","text":"陈君才八斗，何谢建安人。\n不折月中桂，谁怜泉下身。\n高台枕流水，故业委荒蓁。\n忽听山阳笛，凄清满四邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆氏山池","author":"王称","text":"淡淡牵银藻，娟娟种玉莲。\n谁闻照胆镜，中有洗心泉。\n萍散山流影，云收月堕天。\n愿随鸥鹭侣，薄暮宿寒烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄尊师归华山","author":"王称","text":"我送金华子，西归玉女峰。\n瑶笙飞一鹤，宝剑佩双龙。\n人问丹砂诀，天清碧涧钟。\n遥知骑白鹿，韩众定相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人以故将召用","author":"王称","text":"秋风大道傍，立马尽馀觞。\n兴逐孤云远，情随去路长。\n廉颇思赵士，汉主忆冯唐。\n莫奏桓伊笛，萧条两鬓霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云寺赠僧","author":"王称","text":"道林说法处，应在白云边。\n宴坐度小劫，冥观入大千。\n诸天花雨遍，双树慧灯悬。\n何日东林社，相期种白莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏毛女","author":"王称","text":"拂黛逃秦苑，羞蝉入汉年。\n羽毛滋异药，山谷遇真仙。\n夜月思金屋，春风漱玉泉。\n折花寿王母，嬴女解相怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏西施","author":"王称","text":"浣纱白石上，本住越溪滨。\n一入吴王苑，遂为倾国人。\n春华娇艳质，秋水助精神。\n寄谢东邻女，双蛾莫效颦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝退怀南湖草堂寄舍弟及旧社诸游好","author":"王称","text":"朝回独掩扉，高卧息尘机。\n春色如怜客，飞花故点衣。\n雁行惊别久，鹤病忆群稀。\n何日南湖上，春云满棹归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金道士丹室","author":"王称","text":"石洞扫烟霞，仙坛覆落花。\n人间寻鹤侣，天上驻鸾车。\n瑶圃桃成实，金盘枣似瓜。\n待予休物累，从尔问丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春早朝赐酺答郑编修之作","author":"王称","text":"玉历新颁后，千门晓色鲜。\n青云干舜吕，和气入尧年。\n高品初传敕，中庖预列筵。\n愧非枚乘侣，雨露沐恩偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大祀候跸有成","author":"王称","text":"天上开黄道，云间落凤韶。\n侍臣瞻豹尾，列从护鸡翘。\n羡锡皇心豫，春回瑞霭飘。\n万方沾雨露，鼓舞颂轩尧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠羽林翟大","author":"王称","text":"十二羽林郎，星文映上苍。\n承恩当列仗，走马出长杨。\n夜宿平康里，春游侠客场。\n袖中徐匕首，万里报君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁下赠同官王洪 其一","author":"王称","text":"王子才无敌，冰壶映世稀。\n赋成金韵远，诗夺锦袍归。\n入侍趍丹禁，承恩拜琐闱。\n茂陵惭久病，因欲解朝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁下赠同官王洪 其二","author":"王称","text":"日射黄金阙，春回白玉堂。\n地分清切处，人在碧云乡。\n彩笔传天语，宫袍染露香。\n明朝还献赋，迟尔沐恩光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄茅山道士","author":"王称","text":"天转招摇近，山藏句曲深。\n龙归丹井暗，松覆碧坛阴。\n卖药留金诀，看云抱玉琴。\n夜来笙鹤下，相应步虚吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王舜举春日襄阳之作因送之归","author":"王称","text":"汉水千年绿，襄阳二月时。\n人歌大堤曲，春到习家池。\n且纵山公醉，宁同叔子悲。\n葛疆今已老，归马莫教迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得骢马送黄采巡按北京兼寄萧福王选二豸史 其一","author":"王称","text":"锦勒玉花骢，长鸣向北风。\n已看千里去，坐觉万群空。\n喷玉燕山远，鸣銮蓟水通。\n使君同揽辔，早晚奏奇功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得骢马送黄采巡按北京兼寄萧福王选二豸史 其二 赠御医蒋彦文","author":"王称","text":"昔年游海上，晚岁住京华。\n肘秘盘囊诀，炉存伏火砂。\n进方亲御扆，种药借邻家。\n欲问庐山杏，年来几度花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽周员外元","author":"王称","text":"早岁擅芳名，中年一宦成。\n莺花平日泪，烟月故山情。\n落魄嵇中散，猖狂阮步兵。\n可怜埋玉处，芳草傍谁生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵友同还华亭时水泛三吴","author":"王称","text":"积水渺无际，送君江上还。\n九峰何处所，迢递白云间。\n旧业菱荷在，秋风鸥鹭閒。\n定知三泖月，相见一开颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之昆陵","author":"王称","text":"兴尽一杯酒，相看欲别时。\n孤帆乘吹发，一雁度江迟。\n千古兰陵令，秋风季子祠。\n胜游多感慨，为尔寄遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀寄友人还建安","author":"王称","text":"游乏金张援，官无子孟资。\n庖人羞独割，尸祝漫相知。\n此夜金陵月，明朝琼树枝。\n武夷山水郡，相忆在题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友游吴适越","author":"王称","text":"斗酒兴不浅，南游几日回。\n担囊无俗物，访古及吴台。\n腰下延陵剑，手中张翰杯。\n若逢梅福问，相与上天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平直之沔阳学正","author":"王称","text":"楚泽三秋近，荆门一望开。\n沔流缘泮入，巫树拥屏来。\n共讶平当老，谁怜宋玉才。\n凤歌时有客，狂狷待君裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中赠司马秀才","author":"王称","text":"才子茂陵客，何年赋远游。\n家藏封禅草，身著鹔鹴裘。\n未赠王祥剑，先同郭泰舟。\n明朝霄汉上，一鹗看横秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠妓 其一","author":"王称","text":"白雪调歌曲，芳兰托慧心。\n舞回香影乱，笑掩黛痕深。\n夜月牵情梦，秋鸿觅断音。\n江舟司马泪，曾为一沾襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠妓 其二","author":"王称","text":"竹枝歌送君，锦瑟不堪闻。\n欲识芳心恨，愁将宝带分。\n碧峰留黛墨，秋水学湘裙。\n明日阳台上，空瞻一段云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分题赋得白樱桃","author":"王称","text":"嫩叶雕轻翠，新葩倚淡妆。\n鸟来云度影，人静月笼香。\n未拟收珠实，先应倒玉觞。\n纶巾才欲岸，微坠露华凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之蜀郡守","author":"王称","text":"闻道蚕丛国，西连汉陇平。\n三年怀紫袖，万里慰苍生。\n夜月巴川静，秋风锦水清。\n请看霜锷试，莫使雪山倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡扬子江","author":"王称","text":"四月惊涛白，扁舟发大江。\n不因临绝险，那使壮心降。\n天际群峰碧，矶头白马双。\n胜游殊未已，聊尔驻麾幢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳阳送同官王洪中书舍人吴均入蜀","author":"王称","text":"五月不可触，三巴未易行。\n共因严使命，同此念王程。\n月下猿声断，云中鸟道横。\n明朝相忆处，梦绕锦官成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严州江上 其一","author":"王称","text":"短棹荡江春，春风物候新。\n岸花飞送酒，沙鸟近窥人。\n碧树笼青嶂，芳洲点绿蘋。\n因悲城市里，日日醉车尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严州江上 其二","author":"王称","text":"严子投竿处，春来载酒过。\n潮声通越近，山色入吴多。\n沙际舟如月，云边鸟似歌。\n客程随去住，那许叹风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山访李徵士夜归","author":"王称","text":"山翠云边堕，溪声竹外虚。\n寻秋穷谢屐，隔水访陶居。\n邻妪供新酝，家童剪夜蔬。\n醉归萝荜底，残月在襟裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别宗上人","author":"王称","text":"孤琴宿白枌，一锡喜逢君。\n只为谭锋妙，因悲染世氛。\n穷秋灯影靓，残月梵声闻。\n明发身无住，空山又断云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中望九华","author":"王称","text":"云锦积岧峣，屏风倚碧霄。\n猿声听不尽，山翠望还消。\n俗驾何由税，仙人不可招。\n夜深理孤棹，乘月逐归潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孤处士归四明","author":"王称","text":"闻说四明路，迢迢隔剡溪。\n天连沧海阔，树拥白云低。\n山忆谢公咏，人宜贺监栖。\n送君从此去，欲使宦情迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"王称","text":"残雪初消夜，阳光已报春。\n客怀谁共慰，孤烛自相亲。\n寂寞烟霞梦，飘飖霄汉身。\n君恩何以报，来日岁华新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]